    <string name="privacy_browser_unavailable">No browser is available</string>
    <string name="privacy_summary">UVC Dual Camera · HelloFace\n\nThe app uses Android camera permission and USB device access to preview two connected UVC cameras. It reads USB product names and identifiers to list devices. Frames are processed in memory for live preview and pairing. The app does not record, save, collect or share frames or USB device details.\n\nFrame buffers are released when capture ends. Android may restore capture settings and device selections when it recreates the screen. You can clear app data or uninstall to remove local app state and revoke camera access in Android Settings. The app has no accounts, ads or analytics.\n\nPrivacy contact: FaceAISDK.Service@gmail.com</string>
